OL,3,GNEWSAWoman fatally hurt during police
OL,4,Apursuit crash named
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman fatally injured in a crash
OL,7,Fduring a police pursuit in
OL,8,FStratford-upon-Avon has been named by
OL,9,Fthe Independent Office for Police
OL,10,FConduct (IOPC).
OL,12,FKaren Joseph, 62, from the town, died
OL,13,Fin hospital on Friday, four days after
OL,14,Fa collision between a black Audi A3 and
OL,15,Fa Ford Puma on Warwick Road.
OL,17,FThe driver of the Audi died at the
OL,18,Fscene and was named on Thursday as
OL,19,F19-year-old Roman Kalas.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
