OL,3,GNEWSAWoman fatally hurt during police
OL,4,Apursuit crash named
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe police watchdog is investigating
OL,7,Fthe circumstances because Kalas's car
OL,8,Fhad been followed by a Warwickshire
OL,9,FPolice vehicle for about six minutes
OL,10,Fbefore the crash at about 17:40 BST on
OL,11,F24 August.
